-- CONTRACT ------ errors/deterministic_violation_1.march

`mod LeakyDet` (declared `cap deterministic`) declares `needs IO.Clock`, which admits the clock, a nondeterminism source, directly or through a stdlib wrapper such as `DateTime.now`. [deterministic_violation]

Declare only capabilities that are neither the clock nor an RNG (`IO.Console`, `IO.FileRead`, ...), and move the code that reads the clock or an RNG to a module without `cap deterministic`.

